# sys-gym-veilstone (docs/research/gym-puzzles.md): Veilstone Gym's
# punching bags and tyre stacks. Walking into a bag kicks it along the gym's track grid; a stack just past
# its stop topples. A blocked kick swings the bag in place; leaving and re-entering sets the puzzle up again;
# the 10-tile push north (bag 4,22 to 4,12) walks the camera along and is saved and reloaded at rest; the last
# kick (bag 8,7 east to 11,7, stack 12,7 toppled) opens the way to Maylene. The game seed is pinned (`set
# state seed`) so the turning Black Belts face the same way on every run seed: the route battles Rafael when
# he spots the player, Darren and Jeffery from the tile next to them; battles still follow the run seed.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_ALAKAZAM 60 platinum:MOVE_PSYCHIC
set state seed 4242
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_VEILSTONE_CITY_GYM 12 29 up
until idle
+0 screenshot veilstone-before
# a blocked kick: the bag at (15,26) has a wall north of it, so it swings on the spot
+0 press up
until position 12 27
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press right
until position 15 27
+0 release right
until idle
+0 press up
+1 release up
until idle
+0 press up
+1 release up
until idle
+0 assert state mapFeatures.bags[4] {"x": 15, "z": 26}
+0 press left
until position 14 27
+0 release left
until idle
+0 press up
until position 14 26
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press right
+1 release right
until idle
+0 press right
+1 release right
until idle
+0 assert state mapFeatures.bags[4] {"x": 19, "z": 26}
+0 assert state mapFeatures.stacks[8] null
